Third-party software
--------------------
This package does not bundle third-party code. It declares the dependencies
below, which pip installs separately. Each stays under its own license.
Versions are those resolved when this client was tested (2026-10-22).

Required (installed with the package):

  httpx 0.28.1               BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/encode/httpx
  httpcore 1.0.9             BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/encode/httpcore
  h11 0.16.0                 MIT            https://github.com/python-hyper/h11
  anyio 4.12.1               MIT            https://github.com/agronholm/anyio
  idna 3.20                  BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/kjd/idna
  certifi 2026.10.19         MPL-2.0        https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi
  exceptiongroup 1.3.1       MIT            https://github.com/agronholm/exceptiongroup
                                            (Python < 3.11 only)
  typing_extensions 4.16.0   PSF-2.0        https://github.com/python/typing_extensions
                                            (Python < 3.13 only)

